    "section_text": "Minor in Engineering Management A student who receives a bachelor of science degree in an accredited program from Missouri S&T may receive a minor in engineering management by completing 14-15 hours of the courses listed below . ENG MGT 1210 Economic Analysis of Engineering Projects 1 2-3 ENG MGT 2110 Managing Engineering And Technology 3 or ENG MGT 5110 Managerial Decision Making ENG MGT 2211 Engineering Accounting and Finance 3 ENG MGT 3310 Operations and Production Management 3 ENG MGT 3320 Introduction to Project Management 3 or ENG MGT 5320 Project Management Total Credits 14-15 1 Or Eng Mgt 1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, or 5000-level course, not to include Eng Mgt 1100.",
    "section_html": "<div class=\"tab_content\" id=\"minorstextcontainer\">\n<a name=\"minorstext\"></a><h2>Minor in Engineering Management</h2> <p><span data-teams=\"true\">A student who receives a bachelor of science degree in an accredited program from Missouri S&amp;T may receive a minor in engineering management by completing 14-15 hours of the courses listed below</span>.</p> <table class=\"sc_courselist\" width=\"100%\"><colgroup><col class=\"codecol\"/><col class=\"titlecol\"/><col align=\"char\" char=\".\" class=\"hourscol\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr class=\"even firstrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%201210\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 1210');\" title=\"ENG MGT 1210\">ENG MGT 1210</a></td><td>Economic Analysis of Engineering Projects <sup>1</sup></td><td class=\"hourscol\">2-3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%202110\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 2110');\" title=\"ENG MGT 2110\">ENG MGT 2110</a></td><td>Managing Engineering And Technology</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"orclass odd\"><td class=\"codecol orclass\">or <a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%205110\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 5110');\" title=\"ENG MGT 5110\">ENG MGT 5110</a></td><td colspan=\"2\"> Managerial Decision Making</td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%202211\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 2211');\" title=\"ENG MGT 2211\">ENG MGT 2211</a></td><td>Engineering Accounting and Finance</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%203310\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 3310');\" title=\"ENG MGT 3310\">ENG MGT 3310</a></td><td>Operations and Production Management</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even lastrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%203320\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 3320');\" title=\"ENG MGT 3320\">ENG MGT 3320</a></td><td>Introduction to Project Management</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"orclass even lastrow\"><td class=\"codecol orclass\">or <a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=ENG%20MGT%205320\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'ENG MGT 5320');\" title=\"ENG MGT 5320\">ENG MGT 5320</a></td><td colspan=\"2\"> Project Management</td></tr> <tr class=\"listsum\"><td colspan=\"2\">Total Credits</td><td class=\"hourscol\">14-15</td></tr></tbody></table> <dl aria-label=\"Footnotes\" class=\"sc_footnotes\"><dt> <sup> 1 </sup> </dt><dd><p class=\"noindent\">Or Eng Mgt 1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, or 5000-level course, not to include Eng Mgt 1100.</p></dd></dl>\n</div>"
